You can add custom fluids by creating a datapack with the following file paths:

Normal fuel:


epicdatapackname/data/portable engine liquid fuel/data maps/fluid/engine fuel.json


Superheated fuel:


moreepicdatapackname/data/portable engine liquid fuel/data maps/fluid/super engine fuel.json


Example content:


{
 "values": {
